      "successful": 5,
      "failed": 0
   },
   "hits": {
      "total": 0,
      "max_score": null,
      "hits": []
   }
}
```

Whereas from version:  `Version: 1.3.4, Build: a70f3cc/2014-09-30T09:07:17Z, JVM: 1.7.0_65`
and above, it will give the following result:

